  "summary": "Beehive is a Tauri v2 desktop GUI plus a standalone Rust TUI for orchestrating coding agents across isolated git workspace clones ('combs') organized into hives and nests, with persistent PTY terminals, agent panes, and shared on-disk state under ~/.beehive/. Evidence is mostly README product documentation; CLAUDE.md slices are contributor guidance and are excluded from product claims.",
